/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261012T213134-452-7663/wayfinder/20261012T213134-452-7663/tickets/ticket-003.md)**: Phase 3 Administrative Rules and Directives Registry Selection, Authority Querying, and Filter/Citation Schema.\n   - *Authority Selected:* Federal Register API, eCFR API, CMS Transmittals Portal.\n   - *Handoff Keys Emitted:* `operational_filters` (Category 60, PI 40, BETOS O1L, CR 13286) and `clinical_citations` (PMIDs extracted from preambles).\n4. **[`ticket-004.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261012T213134-452-7663/wayfinder/20261012T213134-452-7663/tickets/ticket-004.md)**: Phase 4 Medical Billing, Coverage Determination, and Regional Fee Schedule Schema Reconciliation.\n   - *Authority Selected:* CMS Alpha-Numeric HCPCS Master File, CMS DMEPOS Fee Schedule, Medicare Coverage Database (Article A59508).\n   - *Adjudication Logic:* Direct filtering on `operational_filters` without text search; joins regional fee allowances and ICD-10 diagnostic indications.\n5. **[`ticket-005.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261012T213134-452-7663/wayfinder/20261012T213134-452-7663/tickets/ticket-005.md)**: Phase 5 Advocacy, Budget Estimates, and Peer-Reviewed Literature Context Integration Schema.\n   - *Authority Selected:* Senate SOPR/House Clerk LDA API, CBO Cost Estimates Archive, NCBI Entrez E-utilities API (`esummary`).\n   - *Execution:* Parallel dispatch querying by `target_bill_ids` and `clinical_citations`.\n6. **[`ticket-006.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261012T213134-452-7663/wayfinder/20261012T213134-452-7663/tickets/ticket-006.md)**: Foreign-Key Pipeline Handoff Contracts, Immutable Composite Key Formats, and Lineage Tracking Architecture.\n   - *Standardization:* Locks composite keys, inter-stage contracts, end-to-end lineage, and fail-fast telemetry logging structure.\n7. **[`ticket-007.md`](file:///Users/diese